# Scenario 'browser_brc': controls of 'browser_brl' and 'browser_bra': <br clear=left> outside a list (brl_out.html), after a closed list (brl_after.html) and <br clear=right> inside a list
# (brr_list.html).  Each page ends normally (Html_Tag_Br_ClearLeft / Html_Tag_Br_ClearRight run twice and never retry); B returns to the index between the pages.
# Navigation as in 'browser_r2' (title -> top menu -> ホームページ -> tutorial and prompts -> index of the 'ul' site, traces/web/ul, web=ul); the links of the index are, in order,
# closed, unclosed, brl_list, bra_list, brl_out, brl_after, brr_list (DOWN x N selects link N; the selection starts from none after a B).
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
shot ul_index
tap B
wait 200
shot no_previous_page
tap A
wait 200
tap DOWN x5
wait 80
wait 20
tap A                        # brl_out.html
wait 600
shot brl_out
tap B
wait 300
tap DOWN x5
wait 80
tap DOWN x1
wait 80
wait 20
tap A                        # brl_after.html
wait 600
shot brl_after
tap B
wait 300
tap DOWN x5
wait 80
tap DOWN x2
wait 80
wait 20
tap A                        # brr_list.html
wait 600
shot brr_list
end
